-- Shared by every Talk Script: Benson's voice on the Benson Display.

on show line
  ask display to show line and wait
end show

-- A report's lines play back to back: no other Talk Script's line comes between.
on report lines
  ask display to report lines and wait
end report

-- A line that asks for a key: Player Input then comes to this Run alone
-- until it ends.
on prompt line
  ask display to prompt line and wait
end prompt
